Z||000003||Bob Englert||07-29-2001||09:27 PM||||Jennifer:<P>Each badge is $6 except the gold and silver which are $8 each.  Each badge has the Fiero logo and the car info in the upper half with your name, club (if any), and city and state in the lower half.  They are about 3" x 1 1/2" and include a pin back.<P>I have the following colors available:<BR>white/red letters<BR>white/blue letters<BR>white/black letters<BR>white/gold letters<BR>black/white letters<BR>red/white letters<BR>maroon/white letters<BR>blue/white letters<BR>yellow/black letters<BR>black/gray letters<BR>silver/black letters ($8)<BR>gold/black letters ($8)<P>Just let me know what you want it to say and I will engrave it and bring it to the show this weekend.<P>Thanks...<P>------------------<BR>Bob<BR>2 - 87 GT's<BR>85 SE 4 cyl||||reg||1
